  "name": "cargo-lite",
  "description": "cargo-lite is a minimalist Rust package manager implemented in Python, designed as a lightweight alternative to the official Cargo tool for building and managing Rust crates. It utilizes TOML for manifest configuration and incorporates Blake2 hashing to ensure the cryptographic integrity of package dependencies. The utility streamlines the compilation process by orchestrating Rust compiler invocations and managing local source distributions with minimal system overhead.",
